<title>USA: Stimsonite to search for new CEO.</title>
<headline>Stimsonite to search for new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stimsonite Corp Chief Executive Officer Jay Taylor said on Monday the company will begin a search for his successor.</p>
<p>Taylor said once a candidate is identified and hired, he will retire but remain as a consultant and member of the board.</p>
<p>Stimsonite is a manufacturer of highway safety products.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
